# LOOP 38 cycle 2: density (signs per mm, ink per mm) against text length, by object class (2026-10-03T13:48)
elasticity b = slope of log H on log n (bootstrap 95% CI). b = 1: face width scales with the text (density flat, sized to text); b = 0: fixed face (density rises 1:1 with length, squeezed). Same for ink.

